  "id": "RAW_388400a1db",
  "title": "关于 Astra 和数学的两条关键更新",
  "url": "https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/two-critical-updates-re-astra-and",
  "date": "2026-08-04 00:21:35",
  "author": "Gary Marcus",
  "siteName": "Marcus on AI",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div dir=\"auto\" class=\"body markup\">\n   <p><span>First, abstracting from all the words </span><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/garymarcus/p/openais-amazing-but-vastly-oversold?r=8tdk6&amp;utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=web\">in my long analysis on OpenAI Astra yesterday</a><span>, the overall point was that Astra may not be the breakthrough that OpenAI wants you to think it was. I expressed concerns about how little they revealed about what they did. Moreover, I thought I didn’t stress it there, we all know they are facing huge economic and competitive pressures; they need a win. I am often left with the feeling that their public facing communications are better marketing than they are science.</span></p>\n   <p><span>My jaw dropped a couple hours after my own post, reading this from </span><a href=\"https://alpo.ge/\">Levent Alpöge</a><span>, an accomplished mathematician who works at Anthropic:</span></p>\n   <a href=\"https://x.com/__alpoge__/status/2083855298239078748?s=61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n    <div data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/__alpoge__/status/2083855298239078748?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;so after 24h i have half of them with fable\\n\\ni didn’t see much discussion of prompting in the announcement but this is a similar setup as with my e.g. unit distance announcement:\\n\\ntotally autonomous,\\ngeneric prompt,\\nno internet\\n(+ paranoia to ensure no information leaked)&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;__alpoge__&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;levent&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1824948681877155840/VqVHY3gF_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-02T09:59:53.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;yes, nonsofic groups exist: this statement is one of many new beautiful results proved by Astra, our next major model.\\n\\nWe're releasing 10 such Astra proofs, complete with lean certificates and CoT walkthroughs for each of them. The results are wide-ranging, from von Neumann&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;SebastienBubeck&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sebastien Bubeck&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1709609135321583616/6bXuF85D_normal.jpg&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:52,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:45,&quot;like_count&quot;:894,&quot;impression_count&quot;:288274,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-12 pc-padding-16 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-md sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-lg-kV7yq8 font-text-qe4AeH tweet-fWkQfo twitter-embed\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n      <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n       <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" title=\"User\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n        <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg\" alt=\"X avatar for @__alpoge__\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724172732_VqVHY3gF.jpg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset weight-semibold-uqA4FV reset-IxiVJZ\">levent</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s reset-IxiVJZ\">@__alpoge__</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ text-aFN1BV\">so after 24h i have half of them with fable i didn’t see much discussion of prompting in the announcement but this is a similar setup as with my e.g. unit distance announcement: totally autonomous, generic prompt, no internet (+ paranoia to ensure no information leaked)</div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset elevatedTheme-fBklGV\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-padding-12 pc-boxShadow-none pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-sm sizing-border-box-DggLA4\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n        <div style=\"--scale:20px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-20 pc-height-20 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n         <div style=\"--scale:20px;\" title=\"User\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-20 pc-height-20 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n          <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg\" alt=\"X avatar for @SebastienBubeck\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_6bXuF85D.jpg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n         <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset weight-semibold-uqA4FV reset-IxiVJZ\">Sebastien Bubeck</span> <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s reset-IxiVJZ\">@SebastienBubeck</span>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ text-aFN1BV\">yes, nonsofic groups exist: this statement is one of many new beautiful results proved by Astra, our next major model. We're releasing 10 such Astra proofs, complete with lean certificates and CoT walkthroughs for each of them. The results are wide-ranging, from von Neumann</div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">9:59 AM · Aug 2, 2026</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">288K Views</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">52 Replies</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">45 Reposts</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">894 Likes</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div> \n   </a>\n   <p><em>One </em><span>(obviously smart) guy at Anthropic was able to “replicate” (as best he could given OpenAI’s very sparse report of what they actually did) half of OpenAI’s results within 24 hours. And not with Astra or some other new model, but with the already publicly-released Fable.</span></p>\n   <p>I had a couple reactions to this.</p>\n   <p><span>a. Alpöge’s fast partial replication made me wonder whether OpenAI’s real advance here was finding (through AI) </span><em>which open problems were amenable to a certain kind of search and verify technique</em><span>. OpenAI’s Noam Brown acknowledged, without much detail, that there were failures on some (and maybe many) others:</span></p>\n   <a href=\"https://x.com/polynoamial/status/2083478171975082334?s=61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n    <div data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/polynoamial/status/2083478171975082334?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;And yes we did try other major problems without success. Sadly no Millennium Prize problems (yet).\\n\\nBut also, we didn’t spend a lot on each problem. It’s possible to push test-time compute much further.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;polynoamial&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Noam Brown&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1872883170292457472/8ywVGO5M_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-01T09:01:20.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:66,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:82,&quot;like_count&quot;:1987,&quot;impression_count&quot;:258502,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-12 pc-padding-16 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-md sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-lg-kV7yq8 font-text-qe4AeH tweet-fWkQfo twitter-embed\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n      <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n       <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" title=\"User\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n        <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044619_8ywVGO5M.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044618_8ywVGO5M.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044618_8ywVGO5M.jpg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044618_8ywVGO5M.jpg\" alt=\"X avatar for @polynoamial\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044618_8ywVGO5M.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044619_8ywVGO5M.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803044619_8ywVGO5M.jpg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset weight-semibold-uqA4FV reset-IxiVJZ\">Noam Brown</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s reset-IxiVJZ\">@polynoamial</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ text-aFN1BV\">And yes we did try other major problems without success. Sadly no Millennium Prize problems (yet). But also, we didn’t spend a lot on each problem. It’s possible to push test-time compute much further.</div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">9:01 AM · Aug 1, 2026</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">259K Views</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">66 Replies</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">82 Reposts</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">1.99K Likes</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div> \n   </a>\n   <p>Unfortunately, beyond that OpenAI does not report which problems they tried and failed at. They have given us a numerator without a denominator, always a worrisome sign.</p>\n   <p>This doesn’t take away from OpenAI’s accomplishment - if the system solved a bunch of open problems that’s very impressive – but it again raises questions about what the scope is: all math? A certain subset of problems that can be searched in a certain way?</p>\n   <p>Maybe once that subset has been flagged, maybe many systems can do them. That’s kind of what Levent Alpöge‘s partial replication shows.</p>\n   <p>And many what was most critical was not some innovation in Astra per se but the idea (probably from a human) to do this particular search.</p>\n   <p>b. Alpöge‘s fast partial replication undermines the widespread presumption that Astra is a major breakthrough. Astra is an obviously an advance to some degree, but that degree may well turn out to be merely incremental relative to other recent models.</p>\n   <p><span>Related to this, I was interested to read in </span><em>The Information</em><span> this morning that OpenAI hasn’t decided whether to call Astra (which was an internal code name) GPT 6 or GPT 5.7. If OpenAI truly thought Astra was a quantum leap,, I doubt that would be such a hard choice. </span></p>\n   <p>How good Astra is in open-ended real-world problems very much remains to be seen.</p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\">§</p>\n   <p><span>Second, a longtime reader of this newletter, Ihor Gowda, pointed me to </span><a href=\"https://teorth.github.io/tao-web/slides/age-of-ai-icm-2026.pdf\">a fantastic lecture given by Terence Tao</a><span>, by any measure one of the world’s leading mathematicians; many see Tao as </span><em>the</em><span> leading mathematician. His lecture is lucid, accessible, and genuinely important.</span></p>\n   <p>What’s more you don’t need to be a professional mathematician to read it. It should be mandatory reading for anyone thinking about how AI will affect mathematics, and strongly recommended for anyone who cares about AI’s impact on the world.</p>\n   <p><span>One of the issues that he raises he calls “proof indigestion”; what happens if AI creates a lot of stuff, much of it true, but not necessarily </span><em>useful</em><span>:</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:742,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:254219,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209639471?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_3711388b-f956-4e21-8ccb-28bdf4c0baf2_2165x1104.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p><span>Tao’s July 26th lecture, written before the Astra announcement, also prefigures another key point that I made yesterday: </span><em>being good at creating certain sorts of proofs doesn’t mean that an AI system can contribute to all (or even most) of the goals of mathematics</em><span>. He too distinguishes between solving open problems (which Astra seems strong at, perhaps with some important limits) and building theory (no evidence thus far that Astra can do that):</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:269807,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209639471?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_7ca88110-307c-4ad2-8433-32da31d739c3_2110x1151.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p><span>Tao is no Luddite, or even anti-AI. He is very open to AI, and eager to find a place for it in mathematics. </span><a href=\"https://teorth.github.io/tao-web/slides/age-of-ai-icm-2026.pdf\">His lecture</a><span> is a beautiful read on how to do just that — to bring AI into mathematics, as thoughtfully as possible. Highly recommended.</span></p>\n   <p><span>P.S. Cartoon of the day, illustrating </span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandolini's_law\">Brandolini’s law</a><span>:</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1027,&quot;width&quot;:1213,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1011938,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/209639471?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_b4376bf6-f1ba-4471-88b5-4307e2581a40_1213x1027.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p>Noawadays, as the engineer Wouter Vreugdenhil, who brought the cartoon to my attention, points out, “that’s the game.”</p>\n   <a href=\"https://x.com/wouterw_vreug/status/2084168985033986465?s=61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n    <div data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/wouterw_vreug/status/2084168985033986465?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;&lt;span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;&gt;@GaryMarcus&lt;/span&gt; OpenAI sustain investor faith with minimal effort. Proving them wrong takes years and expertise most people lack. That's the game.🤷‍♂️ &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;WouterW_Vreug&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Wouter Vreugdenhil&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1696517475741880320/-mw0nSoT_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-03T06:46:22.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/HOx0pY5WQAA4uii.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/Jv7olgUFSo&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1,&quot;like_count&quot;:8,&quot;impression_count&quot;:3548,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-12 pc-padding-16 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-md sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-lg-kV7yq8 font-text-qe4AeH tweet-fWkQfo twitter-embed\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n      <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n       <div style=\"--scale:40px;\" title=\"User\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-40 pc-height-40 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n        <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg\" alt=\"X avatar for @WouterW_Vreug\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260803181536_-mw0nSoT.jpg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset weight-semibold-uqA4FV reset-IxiVJZ\">Wouter Vreugdenhil</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s reset-IxiVJZ\">@WouterW_Vreug</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-15-Psle70 weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ text-aFN1BV\">\n      <span class=\"tweet-fake-link\">@GaryMarcus</span> OpenAI sustain investor faith with minimal effort. Proving them wrong takes years and expertise most people lack. That's the game.🤷‍♂️\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset bg-black-dCpgGg outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-sm overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 container-aGHQ9p\">\n      <img src=\"https://pbs.substack.com/media/HOx0pY5WQAA4uii.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"image-c_FmAR\">\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">6:46 AM · Aug 3, 2026</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">3.55K Views</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-text-qe4AeH size-13-hZTUKr weight-regular-mUq6Gb reset-IxiVJZ\">\n       <span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">1 Repost</span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\"> · </span><span class=\"pencraft pc-reset reset-IxiVJZ\">8 Likes</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div> \n   </a>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Gary Marcus 认为，OpenAI 的 Astra 数学结果在 24 小时内就被一个较旧的模型部分复现，这表明该进展是渐进式的而非突破性的，并重点介绍了 Terence Tao 关于 AI 在数学中作用的讲座。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Gary Marcus 认为，OpenAI 的 Astra 数学结果在 24 小时内就被一个较旧的模型部分复现，这表明该进展是渐进式的而非突破性的，并重点介绍了 Terence Tao 关于 AI 在数学中作用的讲座。",
  "summary": "在这篇对 OpenAI Astra 公告早前评论的后续文章中，Gary Marcus 着重指出两项进展。首先，Anthropic 的数学家 Levent Alpöge 据称在 24 小时内使用已经可用的 Fable 模型——而非 Astra 本身——复现了 OpenAI 声称的结果的约一半。Marcus 认为，这削弱了将 Astra 描述为重大突破的说法，并表明真正的贡献可能在于识别哪些开放问题适合采用搜索与验证技术，而非模型本身的根本性创新。他指出，OpenAI 并未披露他们尝试过但失败的问题，只给出了分子而没有分母。其次，Marcus 推荐了 Terence Tao 在 ICM 2026 上关于 AI 与数学的讲座，该讲座引入了“证明消化不良”的概念，并区分了解决开放问题（AI 展现出一定能力）与构建理论（尚无能力证据）。Marcus 将 Tao 描述为既不是卢德分子，也不是炒作驱动者，而是将 AI 融入数学的深思熟虑的引导者。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "一位 Anthropic 数学家在 24 小时内使用较旧的模型复现了 Astra 一半的结果。",
      "explanation": "Levent Alpöge 使用公开可用的 Fable 模型，配合通用提示词，且未接入互联网，部分复现了 OpenAI 声称的证明，表明这一进展可能是渐进式的，而非代际飞跃。"
    },
    {
      "point": "OpenAI 在数学结果上只提供了分子而没有分母。",
      "explanation": "Noam Brown 承认在其他问题上存在失败，但 OpenAI 没有披露尝试了哪些问题，因此无法评估该能力的真实范围。"
    },
    {
      "point": "真正的创新可能在于问题选择，而非模型能力。",
      "explanation": "Marcus 推测，关键的洞见在于识别哪些开放问题适合采用搜索与验证的方法，这一贡献可能是由人类驱动的，而非模型的突破。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Terence Tao 区分了解决开放问题与构建数学理论。",
      "explanation": "Tao 在讲座中认为，擅长生成某些证明并不意味着 AI 能够为数学的更广泛目标做出贡献，这些目标包括构建理论，而不仅仅是解决问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Tao 引入了“证明消化不良”这一概念，将其视为一种风险。",
      "explanation": "如果 AI 产生了大量正确但不一定有用的证明，数学界将面临筛选和优先级排序的问题，而非能力问题。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "或许一旦那个子集被标记出来，许多系统都能做到。Levent Alpöge 的部分复现所展示的正是这一点。",
    "擅长生成某些类型的证明，并不意味着 AI 系统能够为数学的所有（甚至大部分）目标做出贡献。",
    "我经常觉得，他们的公开沟通更像是营销，而不是科学。"
